---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const LAST_UPDATED = '2026-08-20';
---

<Base title="now" description="What I'm doing right now.">
  <div class="now-container"> 
    <h1 class="page-title">now/</h1>

    <p class="now-meta">
      last updated: {LAST_UPDATED} ·
      <a href="https://nownownow.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">what is this?</a>
    </p>

    <div class="now-block">
      <div class="now-block-label">working on</div>
      <ul class="now-list">
        <li>
          <span class="now-item-name">axiom</span>
          — I have successfully integrated the Metal Backend for Axiom as well as ran Llama3.2 1B on it. Got 9 tok/s througput with pure Metal backend. 
          I am now working on getting Qwen3 30B to work and is currently debugging some issues with the integration. 
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="now-block">
      <div class="now-block-label">reading</div>
      <ul class="now-list">
        <li>
          <span class="now-item-name">Databases</span>
          - I am reading this book on <a href="https://www.databass.dev"> Database Internals</a>. I am currently also going through a lot of distributed database
          projects like cockroachDB and FoundationDB for a project I am privately doing which I will share about soon.
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="now-item-name">Apple Neural Engine</span>
          - I found some good resources on the Apple Neural Engine reading the following: <a href="https://maderix.substack.com/p/inside-the-m4-apple-neural-engine">Inside the M4 Apple Neural Engine</a>. I hope this also helps
          me with some of my Axiom work although it is pretty indirect. This is a pretty complex topic and I am still wrapping my head around it.
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="now-item-name">Distributed Systems</span>
          - I am currently following the <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@6.824">MIT6.824 course on Distributed Systems</a>. It's been really insightful so far! I am gonna pair it 
          with my database studies.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style is:global>
  .now-container a {
    text-decoration: none; 
  }

  .now-container a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline !important;
    text-decoration-color: var(--accent) !important; 
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px !important;
    text-underline-offset: 4px !important; 
  }
</style>

<style>
  .now-container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 0;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .now-meta {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--subtle);
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .now-meta a {
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--subtle);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .now-meta a:hover { 
    color: var(--accent-bright); 
  }

  .now-block {
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .now-block-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border);  
    max-width: 750px;
  }

  .now-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem; 
  }

  .now-list li {
    font-size: 15.5px !important; 
    color: var(--muted);
    padding-left: 1.5rem; 
    position: relative;
    line-height: 1.75;
    max-width: 750px; 
  }

  .now-content a {
    color: var(--text); 
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--accent); 
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 4px; 
    transition: color 0.2s ease, text-decoration-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .now-content a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-bright);
    text-decoration-color: var(--accent-bright);
  }

  .now-list li::before {
    content: '→';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--accent); 
    font-weight: bold;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .now-item-name {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>